of sparse tensors).

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.

Examples::

    >>> torch.is_nonzero(torch.tensor([0.]))
    False
    >>> torch.is_nonzero(torch.tensor([1.5]))
    True
    >>> torch.is_nonzero(torch.tensor([False]))
